@php $label=function(?string $type,string $field) use ($catalog){if($field==='status'){return __('الحالة');}if($field==='title'){return __('العنوان');}$entityField=$type?collect($catalog->entity($type)['fields'])->firstWhere('key',$field):null;return $entityField?$catalog->label($entityField['label']):$field;}; $show=fn($value)=>is_array($value)?json_encode($value,JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE):(is_bool($value)?($value?'✓':'✗'):(string)($value ?? '—')); @endphp
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">{{ __('التدقيق') }}</span><h1>{{ __('سجل العمليات') }}</h1><p class="muted">{{ __('عرض زمني لكل العمليات مع التغييرات قبل وبعد. السجل غير قابل للتعديل أو الحذف.') }}</p></div><div class="row-actions">@include('admin.head-stat',['value'=>$page->total(),'label'=>__('إجمالي العمليات')])</div></div>
<form class="card filters filter-panel" method="get" data-filter-panel>@include('admin.filter-head')<label class="field wide"><span>{{ __('بحث') }}</span><input type="search" name="q" value="{{ $filters['q'] ?? '' }}" placeholder="{{ __('بحث بالسجل أو السبب') }}"></label><label class="field"><span>{{ __('العملية') }}</span><select name="action"><option value="">{{ __('كل العمليات') }}</option>@foreach($actions as $action)<option value="{{ $action }}" @selected(($filters['action']??'')===$action)>{{ $action }}</option>@endforeach</select></label><label class="field"><span>{{ __('الكيان') }}</span><select name="type"><option value="">{{ __('كل الكيانات') }}</option>@foreach($types as $key=>$name)<option value="{{ $key }}" @selected(($filters['type']??'')===$key)>{{ $name }}</option>@endforeach</select></label><label class="field"><span>{{ __('المستخدم') }}</span><select name="user"><option value="">{{ __('كل المستخدمين') }}</option>@foreach($users as $id=>$name)<option value="{{ $id }}" @selected((int)($filters['user']??0)===(int)$id)>{{ $name }}</option>@endforeach</select></label><label class="field"><span>{{ __('من') }}</span><input type="date" name="from" value="{{ $filters['from'] ?? '' }}"></label><label class="field"><span>{{ __('إلى') }}</span><input type="date" name="to" value="{{ $filters['to'] ?? '' }}"></label><div class="filter-actions"><button class="button secondary">{{ __('تصفية') }}</button><a class="text-button" href="/admin/operations/audit-log">{{ __('إعادة ضبط') }}</a></div></form>
@forelse($events as $day=>$dayEvents)<section class="card"><h2 dir="ltr">{{ $day }}</h2><ol class="timeline people">@foreach($dayEvents as $event)@php $actor=$event->user_name ?? __('النظام'); @endphp<li><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ mb_strtoupper(mb_substr($actor,0,1)) }}</span><div><div class="event-tags"><b>{{ $actor }}</b><span class="badge">{{ $event->action }}</span>@if($event->record_type)<span class="badge archived">{{ $catalog->label($catalog->entity($event->record_type)['label']) }}</span>@endif</div>@if($event->record_id)<a href="/admin/operations/record/{{ $event->record_id }}">{{ $event->record_title }}</a>@endif
